    Remove and return the `(key, value)` pair most recently used.
    This method supports classes that store their mapping in an
    attribute that provides a ``popitem(last=True)`` method,
    such as ``collections.OrderedDict`` or a standard ``dict`` in
    Python 3.7+ (where dict preserves insertion order).
